# Canonical identities. Several contributors have committed under more than one name or
# email (local git config vs the GitHub web UI), which makes one person look like several
# in `git log`, `git shortlog` and `git blame`. This maps every variant onto one identity.
#
#   Proper Name <proper@email>  Commit Name <commit@email>

